msgid "Seedlots must exist in the database prior to updating or adding inventory. The reason for this is that the inventory does not give information about the content (a named accession or a cross name) and this information is required for a seedlot to exist in the database. We also want to be careful about adding new seedlots into the database because we do not want data to be incorrectly linked to duplicates."
